      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As a director of a major global organization, framing this as a matter of **global justice** will resonate strongly with committed donors. You can argue that supporting vulnerable, under-resourced global communities is a fundamental ethical obligation of a powerful, wealthy nation.  Furthermore, emphasizing that stability in one part of the world ultimately benefits all, through global health and trade, makes the argument a powerful **self-interest win for the country and its ethical supporters as well.",
      "source": "target",
